1
00:00:00,010 --> 00:00:00,870
Bend your wrist

2
00:00:00,870 --> 00:00:02,160
all the way down.

3
00:00:02,160 --> 00:00:02,925
Now squeeze

4
00:00:02,925 --> 00:00:04,720
a tight fist.

5
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:05,530
Can't?

6
00:00:05,530 --> 00:00:06,047
Your fingers

7
00:00:06,047 --> 00:00:07,460
have no muscles.

8
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:08,160
They're...

9
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:09,333
puppets.

10
00:00:09,383 --> 00:00:10,640
Squeeze again.

11
00:00:10,640 --> 00:00:12,000
See your forearm move?

12
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,333
That's the puppeteer.

13
00:00:13,361 --> 00:00:14,157
Wrist down?

14
00:00:14,157 --> 00:00:14,812
His strings

15
00:00:14,812 --> 00:00:15,796
go slack.

16
00:00:15,796 --> 00:00:17,267
No pull left.

17
00:00:17,310 --> 00:00:18,240
Now tip your wrist

18
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:19,892
back and squeeze.

19
00:00:19,892 --> 00:00:20,800
Clamp!

20
00:00:20,910 --> 00:00:21,320
People with

21
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:22,243
paralyzed fingers

22
00:00:22,243 --> 00:00:23,512
grab things this way.

23
00:00:23,512 --> 00:00:24,384
The strings

24
00:00:24,384 --> 00:00:25,300
close the hand

25
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:26,360
for them.

26
00:00:26,405 --> 00:00:28,390
Now bend it down again...

27
00:00:28,390 --> 00:00:28,925
and watch

28
00:00:28,925 --> 00:00:30,760
the puppet flop.

